{"title":"Art In Motion 10K/5K/2K — 10th Anniversary Charity Run & Walk","startsAt":"2026-10-18T10:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-18T13:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**Join us for the 10th Anniversary of the Art In Motion 10K/5K/2K!**\nRun or walk with us at Boyd Conservation Area in Vaughan for a community race supporting children and youth living with arthritis.\n\nChoose from the **10K, 5K or 2K** and enjoy a full race-day experience including finisher medals for 10K & 5K participants, professional race photos, post-race refreshments, pancake breakfast, complimentary massages, and more.\n\n**Sunday, October 18, 2026**\n**Boyd Conservation Area • Vaughan, Ontario**\n\n100% of event proceeds support **SickKids Foundation and the Dr. Bonnie Cameron Post-Secondary Scholarship**, helping children and youth living with arthritis receive exceptional care and pursue their educational goals.\n\n**Important:** Joining this Meetup does **not** register you for the race.\n👉 **Race details & official registration:**\n**[https://artinmotion10k.com/](https://artinmotion10k.com/)**","venue":{"name":"Boyd Conservation Area","address":"8739 Islington Avenue, Vaughan","lat":43.81,"lng":-79.58666,"city":"Vaughan"},"fee":null,"group":"Artinmotion running","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/f/c/a/highres_535760426.jpeg"}